Intentionally empty. The research collection exists in content.config.ts and the
/research/ route guards on papers.length, so the site renders correctly with no
papers. This file only keeps the directory present so the glob loader does not
warn about a missing base dir.

Do not add a .md/.mdx file here unless it is real work by a real author with a
reproducible result — see the Honesty rules in AGENTS.md.
